      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "594728c9ca8f33b4",
      "translationZh": "查看由 Yufei Sun 及另外2位作者撰写的论文《SPT：将技能用作智能体语言模型的预训练数据》的 PDF",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
